    "sentences": [
      "Kaya decided to attend an important fourth lesson.",
      "It was a quite windy and cloudy, not snowy, day.",
      "She had a thought to visit the warm nursing home.",
      "Her little neighbor arrived to join the culture tour.",
      "They would hold a chicken lemonade sale for money.",
      "Kaya even ran to the shop for supplies.",
      "A letter about Hawaii cancer research appeared.",
      "It spoke of an old man's age, only away now.",
      "Then rain began to drop, and a minute later, a blackout!",
      "They had to turn off the lights, but weren't scared.",
      "Kaya didn't scream; she thought it was cool drama.",
